## Admin (v2)

All under **`/v2/admin/*`** with admin JWT. Admin = email in `admin_users` with `is_active = true`. 403 if not admin.

**Students:** `GET /v2/admin/students` (limit, offset) → `{ students: [ { user_id, email, user_email, sessions_count?, last_session_at?, avg_performance? } ], limit, offset }`. `GET /v2/admin/students/<id>` → profile: `user_id`, `email`, `overrides` (arrays: `assigned_post_question_ids`, `assigned_next_task_ids`), `speaker_profile` (e.g. `coach_notes`), `warm_up_tasks`, `last_report`, `last_report_preview`, `sessions` (id, created_at, status, report_preview.report_text_preview). `PUT .../overrides` (assigned_next_task_ids, assigned_post_question_ids exactly 3, optional assigned_warm_up_task_id). `PUT .../speaker-profile` body `{ coach_notes?, ... }`. `POST .../send-assignment` → `{ status: "ok" }`.

**Warm-up tasks (per student):** `GET/POST /v2/admin/students/<id>/warm-up-tasks`, `PUT/DELETE .../warm-up-tasks/<task_id>`.

**Session/report (admin):** `GET /v2/admin/students/<id>/sessions/<session_id>` (full session, context_long_entries). `PATCH .../sessions/<session_id>/report` body `{ action: "append"|"replace", text?, entries? }`.

**Pools:** Tasks: `GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /v2/admin/tasks`. Post-recording questions: `GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /v2/admin/post-recording-questions`. Metrics (5): `GET/PUT /v2/admin/metrics`. Metric questions (1 & 2): `GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /v2/admin/metric-questions`. Exercises: endpoints exist but simplified admin doesn’t use them.

**Mockup alignment:** One student profile page — Homework Configuration (Send Homework, Save overrides, warm-up list, focus tasks, questions, metrics), Speaker Profile (Context → coach_notes), Last Report / Reports history from sessions.

